      "id": "m0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "author": "user",
      "text": "How far can a tin can telephone carry a voice?",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T10:00:00.000Z",
      "sources": []
    },
    {
      "id": "m0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "author": "bot",
      "text": "About **30 metres** with a taut string [1][2].",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T10:00:05.000Z",
      "sources": [
        { "title": "Example Physics", "url": "https://physics.example/tin-can" },
        { "title": "String Lab", "url": "https://strings.example/range" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "author": "user",
      "text": "And with wire instead of string?",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T10:05:00.000Z",
      "sources": []
    },
    {
      "id": "m0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "author": "bot",
      "text": "Wire carries it further, a few hundred metres.",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T10:05:30.000Z",
      "sources": []
    }
  ]
